743
00:42:36,216 --> 00:42:37,522
SIG-003 · 1.

744
00:42:37,522 --> 00:42:40,134
"Pages get slower": a listener leak

745
00:42:41,259 --> 00:42:42,363
Fix: register cleanup.

746
00:42:42,363 --> 00:42:44,203
An effect's callback receives onCleanup.

747
00:42:44,203 --> 00:42:48,252
The cleanup runs before the effect runs again and when the

748
00:42:48,252 --> 00:42:52,301
effect is destroyed, which happens automatically when the component is destroyed.

