838
00:48:27,078 --> 00:48:28,737
@acme/ui ships a data table.

839
00:48:28,737 --> 00:48:32,057
One product team reports: "After a user sorts the table,

840
00:48:32,057 --> 00:48:35,376
our 'Export CSV' button exports rows in the sorted order,

841
00:48:35,376 --> 00:48:40,023
and our row numbers are wrong." Another team reports that the table re-renders every

842
00:48:40,023 --> 00:48:42,347
