910
00:53:01,331 --> 00:53:02,900
SIG-004 · 5.

911
00:53:02,900 --> 00:53:04,993
Locale-unaware and type-unaware comparison

912
00:53:06,118 --> 00:53:09,689
String(value).localeCompare sorts 10 before 9, sorts dates as

913
