text, and uses the browser's default locale.

914
00:53:12,813 --> 00:53:16,384
A shared table should accept a comparator per

915
00:53:16,384 --> 00:53:19,955
column and default to Intl.Collator with numeric: true.

916
00:53:21,331 --> 00:53:24,779
SIG-004 · Answer · code 1/5

917
00:53:25,904 --> 00:53:31,076
The correction preserves consumer data, tracks records, and provides accessible sorting controls.

918
00:53:32,451 --> 00:53:35,819
SIG-004 · Answer · code 2/5

919
00:53:36,944 --> 00:53:41,996
The correction preserves consumer data, tracks records, and provides accessible sorting controls.

920
00:53:43,371 --> 00:53:46,955
